/*************************** fs (file system) ****************/
/*
fs is a built-in Node.js module that allows your JavaScript code to interact with files and folders on your computer/server.

You use fs whenever your application needs to:

✔ Read a file
✔ Create a file
✔ Update a file
✔ Delete a file
✔ Work with folders (directories)
✔ Store data locally */